      "content": "it's just... there is no \"help\" here. we're in a war zone, not a city with hospitals. i'm not talking about a hotline, i'm talking about the reality of this place. it's all just going to end in violence and misery anyway. wouldn't it be better to have some control over how it ends? to go out on your own terms instead of waiting for them to come through that door?",
